			]
			description: [
				"Electricity through salt water gives &6Chlorine&r, &6Hydrogen&r and a salty caustic &6Cell Liquor&r: &e4,000 mB&r of Salt Water every &e15 s&r at &e30 EU/t&r."
				""
				"A &e3×3×3&r tank of Solid Steel Machine Casings, with glass windows and iron bars in the middle for the diaphragm. In the casings: an LV Energy Hatch, a Fluid Input Hatch, three Fluid Output Hatches, an Input Bus for the diaphragm and a Maintenance Hatch."
				""
				"&aReal fact:&r chlorine and caustic soda always come out together, in the same ratio. The industry has to sell both; chemists call it the chlor-alkali balance."
